  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Why stop with just one spell when you can walk off with half the contents of a wizard's brain?</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Know any one of filch the gift, pilfer the gift, steal the gift; assassin level 9th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you execute the filch the gift, pilfer the gift, or steal the gift techniques, if you have exactly one spell retained by that technique, you do not lose it when you attempt to steal another one. If you have exactly two spells retained by that technique, choose one of the two spells to lose immediately.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/assassin-feats#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
